Third-party assets, all bundled for offline use:
- Archivo variable font, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (frontend/fonts/OFL-Archivo.txt).
- Geist Mono font, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (frontend/fonts/OFL-GeistMono.txt).
- World map: world-atlas 2.0.2 (ISC, frontend/vendor/LICENSE-world-atlas.txt),
  derived from Natural Earth, which is in the public domain.
- mmdb-lib (MIT), the MaxMind DB format reader used for DB-IP City Lite.
- Noto Sans, Noto Sans Arabic, Noto Sans Hebrew, Noto Sans Thai, Noto Sans KR
  and Noto Sans SC, for text in PDF reports that Helvetica can't draw, SIL Open
  Font License 1.1 (backend/fonts/OFL-*.txt). Cut down to the scripts they
  serve and pinned to static weights; ATTRIBUTIONS.md lists the changes.
- harfbuzzjs (MIT), HarfBuzz compiled to WebAssembly, which shapes that text
  and subsets those fonts when a PDF is written.
- AI app marks in frontend/js/ai-logos.js: Simple Icons 16.36.0 (CC0-1.0,
  https://simpleicons.org). Each mark is a trademark of its owner, shown only
  to name the app; ATTRIBUTIONS.md lists them and the brand terms checked.
- Optional, not bundled: DB-IP City Lite (CC BY 4.0, https://db-ip.com),
  downloaded only when the person asks for it.

frontend/data/atlas-fusion.json is a dated snapshot of the schema metadata the
undocumented Sophos Fusion GraphQL query qlSchemaMapV1 returns.
frontend/data/atlas-datalake.json is built from the public Sophos Data Lake
schema JSON on docs.sophos.com. Both describe Sophos's schemas and remain
Sophos's material; this project's licence does not cover them.

